  <!--EN: Adorns the hollow golem with a gem containing condense arcane energy, allowing it to create a concentrated bolt of dark energy. Darkbolt targets enemies up to 120 cells away. Costs 50 energy. Dark bolts are slow moving but create a massive explosion of dark energy. Only one focus gem may be attached to a golem.-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGArcane.description>用含有浓缩奥术能量的宝石装饰空洞傀儡，使其能够产生一束由集中的暗能量构成的箭。黑暗之箭的目标是100格以外的敌人。消耗80能量。一个傀儡只能装饰一个集中宝石。</TM_HollowGolem_FGArcane.description>
  <!--EN: crafting golem part-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGArcane.jobString>制造傀儡部位</TM_HollowGolem_FGArcane.jobString>
  <!--EN: Focus Gem: Arcane-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGArcane.label>集中宝石：奥术</TM_HollowGolem_FGArcane.label>
  <!--EN: Adorns the hollow golem with a gem containing death's essence, surrounding the golem with a field radiating death. Death Field periodically strikes nearby enemies. This ability is the only focus gem that does not require casting. Targets enemies within 10 cells of the golem and costs 10 energy per strike. Only one focus gem may be attached to a golem.-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGDeath.description>用含有死亡精华的宝石装饰空洞傀儡，那个宝石会辐射死亡能量场包围傀儡。死亡场会定期攻击附近的敌人。这个技能是唯一不需要施法的集中宝石技能。目标是傀儡10格内的敌人。消耗20点能量，但场内每个死亡的任何生物都能使傀儡获得免费一击。一个傀儡只能装饰一个集中宝石。</TM_HollowGolem_FGDeath.description>
  <!--EN: crafting golem part-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGDeath.jobString>制造傀儡部位</TM_HollowGolem_FGDeath.jobString>
  <!--EN: Focus Gem: Death-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGDeath.label>集中宝石：死亡</TM_HollowGolem_FGDeath.label>
  <!--EN: Adorns the hollow golem with a fire element focus gem allowing it to use the fire blossom ability. Fire blossom creates 25 explosive firebolts and targets a cluster of enemies from 6 to 70 cells away. Consumes 20 energy. Only one focus gem may be attached.-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGFire.description>用火元素集中宝石装饰空洞傀儡，使其能够使用火之花技能。火之花用于制造25个能爆炸的火箭，目标是傀儡周边6到50格的敌人（优先以多个敌人集中的地方为目标）。消耗40能量。目标可能会被点燃。只能附加一个集中宝石。</TM_HollowGolem_FGFire.description>
  <!--EN: crafting golem part-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGFire.jobString>制造傀儡部位</TM_HollowGolem_FGFire.jobString>
  <!--EN: Focus Gem: Fire-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGFire.label>集中宝石：火焰</TM_HollowGolem_FGFire.label>
  <!--EN: Adorns the hollow golem with a gem containing elemental water allowing it to use the ice blossom ability. Ice Blossom creates a burst of 20 ice shards and targets a cluster of enemies from 8 to 80 cells away. Costs 30 energy. Ice shards inflict high amounts of bleeding and work best on concentrated, lightly armored targets. Only one focus gem may be attached to a golem.-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGIce.description>用水元素集中宝石装饰空洞傀儡，使其能够使用冰之花技能。冰之花会制造20个会爆炸的冰之碎片，目标是8到60格之外的敌人（优先以多个敌人集中的地方为目标）。消耗60能量。冰之碎片会造成大量出血。只能附加一个集中宝石。</TM_HollowGolem_FGIce.description>
  <!--EN: crafting golem part-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGIce.jobString>制造傀儡部位</TM_HollowGolem_FGIce.jobString>
  <!--EN: Focus Gem: Ice-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_FGIce.label>集中宝石：寒冰</TM_HollowGolem_FGIce.label>
  <!--EN: The Flames of Devouring Apathy grant a hollow golem the ability to regulate temperature. The flames will also consume any filth within 25 cells and emit a faint mystical light. These effect are only active while the hollow golem is dormant. The flames of devouring apathy and orb of extinguishing flames cannot be used together, these two upgrades share the same component slot.-->
