  <!--EN: Equipping the hollow golem with the Orb of Extinguished Flames allows it to peek behind the veil of death to extract knowledge. Points into the active research technology will increase for every pawn killed on the map. The orb can also be toggled to detect and consume any fire within 25 cells and emits a faint silver light. These effect are only active while the hollow golem is dormant. The flames of devouring apathy and orb of extinguishing flames cannot be used together, these two upgrades share the same component slot.-->
